./core
./error
./number
./stream
./string

+ Size is I64
+ Index is I64
+ Increment is I64

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ Range'Item is Tuple
    is CursorIterable'Item'(Item, Item, Size, Size)
    is Indexable'Item

+ start Item
+ end Item
+ increment Item = Item() + 1
+ is-through = false

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is CursorIterable'Item ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ get initial-iterator-state (Item, Item, Size, Size) @inline

start, step, 0, length
    .. step = if start <= end then increment else Item() - increment

────────────────────
+ do next-iterator ((Item, Item, Size, Size), Item?) @inline
    - state (Item, Item, Size, Size)

if state[3] == 0
    . none Item?
    = (state, none)
if Item.is-integer
    = ((state[0] + state[1], state[1], state[2], state[3] - 1), state[0])
else
    = ((state[0], state[1], state[2] + 1, state[3] - 1), this[state[2]])

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Indexable'Item ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ get length Size @inline

|? Item.is-integer
    |? is-through
        (distance / step + 1) as Size
    |? distance == 0
        0
    ??
        ((distance - 1) / step + 1) as Size
    .. distance = (new-end as I64 as U64) - (new-start as I64 as U64)
    .. step = increment as U64
??
    whole-steps + final-item-count
    .. whole-steps = (delta / increment) as Size
    .. final-item-count = if includes-final-item then 1 else 0
    .. includes-final-item = is-through || has-partial-step
    .. has-partial-step = stepped-distance < delta
    .. stepped-distance = (whole-steps as Item) * increment
    .. delta = new-end - new-start

.. new-start = if start > end then end else start
.. new-end = if start > end then start else end

────────────────────
+ this[index Index] Item @inline

|? start > end
    start - (index as Item) * increment
??
    start + (index as Item) * increment

────────────────────
+ this[range Range'Index] Indexable'Item

Range'Item(start + range.start, start + range.end, increment, is-through)

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ this[pos Position]

this[pos.normalize(this)]

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ Sequencing and normalization ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ forward @inline

This(first, last, increment, false)

.. first = if start > end then end + n1 else start
.. last = if start > end then start + increment else end + n0
.. n0 = if is-through then increment else 0
.. n1 = if is-through then Item() else increment

────────────────────
+ normalize'SeqItem @inline
    - seq Indexable'SeqItem

Range'Index(s, e, i, is-through)

.. len = seq.length
.. s = normalize(start, 0 .. < len)
.. e = normalize(end, 0 .. < len)
.. i = normalize(increment, 0 .. < len)

────────────────────
+ this
    - increment () Item
        - item Item

Stepper(this, increment)

────────────────────
+ to String

"[Range $start $to-or-thru $end by $increment]"
    .. to-or-thru = if is-through then "thru" else "to"

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ Position is Union

| first
| middle
| last
| end
| infinity
| index Index

────────────────────
+ normalize'Item Index @inline
    - seq Indexable'Item

normalize(0 .. < seq.length)

────────────────────
+ normalize'SeqItem Index
    - range Range'SeqItem

match this
    `
    | Position.first
        start
    | Position.middle
        length / 2
    | Position.last
        length - 1
    | Position.end
        length
    | Position.infinity
        Index.max
    | Position.index(n)
        n
    `
    .. start = range.start
    .. length = range.length

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ Numeric range types ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ Explicit range constructors ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ to'RangeItem
    - start RangeItem
    - end RangeItem
    - increment RangeItem?

Range'RangeItem(start, end, increment, false)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ thru'RangeItem
    - start RangeItem
    - end RangeItem
    - increment RangeItem?

Range'RangeItem(start, end, increment, true)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ normalize'T
    - n Int
    - range Range'T

n

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ normalize'T
    - n Position
    - range Range'T

n.normalize(range)
